  "solution_steps": [
    "Restore the western antenna power. Align its reflector and position the lens cargo on the load scale. Interact with the west recorder while both readings are live.",
    "Cross the gap and access the eastern reserve selector. Switch it to B; the western reading remains stored, so returning does not lose progress.",
    "Return to the central stair. From its first shelf, latch EVAC PROOF while the western record and eastern B bus are available.",
    "Return east only when the final route has been planned, arm the countdown, climb the central staircase and pass through the moon gate."
